WEBVTT

1
00:00:00.069 --> 00:00:08.804
Cora and Darla swam toward the compass.

2
00:00:08.805 --> 00:00:13.986
On the way they saw Mo.

3
00:00:13.987 --> 00:00:18.381
Cora told him about Darla's problem.

4
00:00:18.382 --> 00:00:23.958
"I'll help too!" Mo said.

5
00:00:23.959 --> 00:00:33.755
Soon they reached the cave.

6
00:00:33.756 --> 00:00:41.068
"Where's the compass?" Darla asked.

7
00:00:41.069 --> 00:00:45.425
"I'll show you," Cora said.

8
00:00:45.426 --> 00:00:48.412
Cora shot her ink at the shell.

9
00:00:48.413 --> 00:00:52.230
"Ta-da," Cora said proudly.

10
00:00:52.231 --> 00:00:56.972
"And now the compass will open."

11
00:00:56.973 --> 00:01:00.146
But the compass did not open.

12
00:01:00.147 --> 00:01:05.855
"Hmm." Cora shot more ink.

13
00:01:05.856 --> 00:01:12.216
The compass still did not open.

14
00:01:12.217 --> 00:01:17.069
Cora swam around the compass.

15
00:01:17.070 --> 00:01:20.292
Then she saw the problem.

16
00:01:20.293 --> 00:01:25.172
"There's algae growing on the compass!" she said.

17
00:01:25.173 --> 00:01:29.890
"Grr." Cora tried to pry open the shell.

18
00:01:29.891 --> 00:01:32.844
"It won't open!"

19
00:01:32.845 --> 00:01:36.794
Mo tried scraping the algae with his spikes.

20
00:01:36.795 --> 00:01:40.056
That didn't work either.

21
00:01:40.057 --> 00:01:43.064
"Ugh!" Cora said.

22
00:01:43.065 --> 00:01:46.035
Darla looked at the compass.

23
00:01:46.036 --> 00:01:48.589
"I know this algae.

24
00:01:48.590 --> 00:01:53.672
It covered the reef where my family lived."

25
00:01:53.673 --> 00:01:58.958
"How did you clean it off?" Cora asked.

26
00:01:58.959 --> 00:02:04.133
"We couldn't clean it off," Darla said.

27
00:02:04.134 --> 00:02:06.296
"So we left.

28
00:02:06.297 --> 00:02:09.386
That's when I got lost."

29
00:02:09.387 --> 00:02:12.321
"Don't worry, Darla," Mo said.

30
00:02:12.322 --> 00:02:14.381
"We'll find your family."

31
00:02:14.382 --> 00:02:16.145
Cora nodded.

32
00:02:16.146 --> 00:02:19.906
"As soon as we get the compass open!"

